{
  "_comment": [
    "OPT-IN, PER-FORK plugin enablement (red-team R5). Copy this file to",
    ".claude/settings.local.json -- which is gitignored -- to turn the plugins on for",
    "YOUR checkout. It is deliberately not committed: `enabledPlugins` plus",
    "`extraKnownMarketplaces` makes every fork of this template fetch and run code from",
    "third-party GitHub repos at session start, with no one having chosen that. A fork",
    "operator opting in is a decision; a fork operator inheriting it is a supply chain.",
    "",
    "Pin the marketplace refs before trusting them. `source.repo` tracks the default",
    "branch, so what you run is whatever those repos hold the day your session starts.",
    "CLAUDE.md routes real multi-file features through Superpowers (brainstorm -> spec ->",
    "plan -> TDD); with the plugin off, the built-in /blueprint + writing-plans path",
    "covers the same ground.",
    "",
    "Remove this _comment key in your own copy -- it is documentation, not settings."
  ],
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "claude-code-plugins": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "anthropics/claude-code"
      }
    },
    "superpowers": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "obra/superpowers"
      }
    }
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "frontend-design@claude-code-plugins": true,
    "superpowers@superpowers": true
  }
}
